<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa defeated India by six wickets in their one-day international match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 179-9 innings closed (M.Azharuddin 57, R.Dravid 50), South Africa 180-4 in 45.1 overs (Jacques Kallis 79).</p>
